  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "검색 지연 p50 / p90(일별)",
   "description": "turns.search_ms(2026-11-11~) — 한 턴에서 search-service(/search · /embed)를 기다린 시간 합, status=ok 만. 검색하지 않은 턴(일반 · 사내규정 개인화)은 NULL이라 빠진다. 업무특화 코드 답 턴은 검색 뒤에 답하므로 들어간다",
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "mysql",
      "uid": "petmint-mysql"
     },
     "rawSql": "SELECT TIMESTAMP(d) AS time,\n  MAX(CASE WHEN pr <= 0.5 THEN v END) / 1000 AS `검색 p50`,\n  MAX(CASE WHEN pr <= 0.9 THEN v END) / 1000 AS `검색 p90`\nFROM (SELECT DATE(created_at) AS d, search_ms AS v,\n        PERCENT_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY DATE(created_at) ORDER BY search_ms) AS pr\n      FROM turns WHERE status = 'ok' AND search_ms IS NOT NULL AND $__timeFilter(created_at)) x\nGROUP BY d ORDER BY d",
     "format": "time_series",
     "rawQuery": true,
     "editorMode": "code",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
